<title>USA: TCC Industries names Thomajan as president.</title>
<headline>TCC Industries names Thomajan as president.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCC Industries Inc said on Friday that it had elected Robert Thomajan as its new president, succeeding Lawrence Schumann, who resigned early in July.</p>
<p>Thomajan was elected as company secretary at the time of Schumann's resignation.</p>
</text>
